  finalCtaText="Tell us about your Ajax project through the form and we'll send a free written quote. No pressure, no surprises."
>
  <p>Ajax grew fast, and a lot of its concrete is now at the age where small problems become visible: hairline cracks widening at the joints, walkway sections lifting, front steps losing their nosings. From the lakeside streets along the waterfront trail up through the village and the newer north end, <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> keeps Ajax concrete level, safe and looking sharp, backed by a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>The most common Ajax job we see is the front entrance package: walkway and steps together. Doing them in one visit means one excavation, one pour schedule and finishes that match, and it costs less than splitting the work across two contractors and two summers.</p>

  <h2>Concrete work in Ajax: what we do</h2>
  <p>Most of our Ajax calls fall into a few buckets:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements and new pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">front steps</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">shed slabs</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porch</a> repairs and rebuilds</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-repair/">Repair</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a> and <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Same quote, same warranty as Toronto</h2>
  <p>We do not price by distance. An Ajax job gets the same free written quote, the same materials, the same 2-year warranty and the same satisfaction guarantee as a job down the street from us. We are in Durham every week, so scheduling is straightforward.</p>

  <h2>Why Ajax homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of local experience and hundreds of concrete jobs across Toronto and the surrounding areas. Straight answers, a written quote with no pressure, and a crew that sticks to the schedule.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Getting started is simple. Send a few photos and a short description through the form, and we follow the same clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a> on every job. We also work next door in <a href="/locations/pickering/">Pickering</a> and <a href="/locations/whitby/">Whitby</a>, so one call covers family or rental properties nearby.</p>
